  articleID: https://NewManilaColosseum/Events
  title: Concert Floods !
  headliner: <b>Massive Rainstorm Floods Colosseum Perimeter As November Boulevard
    Arrives</b>
  bodyText: "An unfortunate turn of events has struck the makeshift encampments outside
    the New Manila Colosseum after a sudden torrential downpour flooded the surrounding
    plaza just hours before November Boulevard\u2019s scheduled arrival. \r\n\r\n\r\nLink:\r\n"
  externalLinkBodyText: "Despite waist-deep puddles, soaked sleeping bags, and repeated
    warnings from city emergency responders urging crowd evacuation, thousands of
    die-hard supporters remain steadfastly glued to their front-row positions. \r\n\r\nFan
    club leaders were seen hoisting plastic tarps and using cooler lids to bail out
    water while chanting band anthems in unison, refusing to abandon the campsite
    they built yesterday. \r\n"
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - THE RAIN WONT STOP US, IT WONT STOP ME !
  - Damn, so not even floods can keep them away !
  - IT'S ALL FOR THE MUSIC BABY YEAH !
  - "I got an umbrella, ill be fine\u2026"
